OL,3,GNEWSABid for #500,000 to transform
OL,4,Aseaside library
OL,5,
OL,6,FA bid for #500,000 has been submitted
OL,7,Ffor a major programme of improvements
OL,8,Fto a seaside town's library.
OL,10,FRedcar and Cleveland Council hopes the
OL,11,Fapplication to the Arts Council's
OL,12,FLibrary Improvement Fund will pay for
OL,13,Frepairs and upgrades to Saltburn
OL,14,FLibrary.
OL,16,FThe council said the funding, if
OL,17,Fgranted, would cover roof repairs,
OL,18,Fimprovements to the building's
OL,19,Fexterior, replacement windows and
OL,20,Fdoors, and mechanical and electrical
OL,21,Fupgrades.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,394,390,260,160,0,100
